    "created_at": "2016-03-10T09:41:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-10T09:41:13Z",
    "body": "I haven't checked but I guess Firefox also has similar port blocking for HTTP. If so, it makes sense to incorporate it into the Fetch spec.\n\nCurrently XHR in Chromium results in network error while WebSocket throws as you said. Regardless of the form of error adopted, the banned ports have been not working for Chromium. So, it shouldn't be a pain for us to converge the way of error notification.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
