    "updated_at": "2016-03-10T12:16:36Z",
    "body": "Thank you @tyoshino, that was very helpful. I have added port blocking to Fetch. Per the commit listed above. My proposal is that we remove the port blocking from the WebSocket API since it's redundant.\n",
